TITLE  Gamma 546keV attenuation in cellulose
       .
GSTART >>>>>>>>
LAYER  0.0  0.15                                         [Z_lower and Z_higher]
CYLIND 1 0.0 10.0                                  [raggio 1 cm]
GEND   <<<<<<<<
       .
       >>>>>>>> Source definition.
SKPAR  2                                          [photons]
SENERG 546e3
SGPOL  0 0 0                                      [non polarised]
SPOSIT 0 0 -0.05                                  [sorgente prima della lastra]
SCONE  0 0 180                                      [fascio parallelo +z]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Material data and simulation parameters.
MFNAME Cellulose.mat
MSIMPA 1e4 1e4 1e4 1.0 1.0 1e3 1e3                [FAST + corretto]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Job properties.
NSIMSH 10e7                                      [statistica iniziale]
TIME   3600                                        [10 minuti max]